{"step_index":348,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:45:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-20T11:45:11-04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-20T11:45:11-04:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`\nTotal Lines: 1292\nTotal Bytes: 37785\nShowing lines 500 to 580\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n500:         {/* FRS Report Card Checkboxes / Hot-Buttons */}\n501:         {currentLead.frs_interests && currentLead.frs_interests.length > 0 && (\n502:           <View style={styles.interestsBox}>\n503:             <Text style={styles.interestsHeader}>REPORT CARD NEEDS & QUESTIONS:</Text>\n504:             {currentLead.frs_interests.map((interest, idx) => (\n505:               <View key={idx} style={styles.interestRow}>\n506:                 <Check size={14} color=\"#10B981\" />\n507:                 <Text style={styles.interestText}>{interest}</Text>\n508:               </View>\n509:             ))}\n510:           </View>\n511:         )}\n512: \n513:         {/* Custom Written Questions */}\n514:         {currentLead.custom_questions ? (\n515:           <View style={styles.customQuestionBox}>\n516:             <HelpCircle size={14} color=\"#F59E0B\" />\n517:             <Text style={styles.customQuestionText}>\n518:               Q: \"{currentLead.custom_questions}\"\n519:             </Text>\n520:           </View>\n521:         ) : null}\n522: \n523:         {/* Preferred Meeting Availability Callout */}\n524:         {currentLead.meeting_preferences && currentLead.meeting_preferences.length > 0 && (\n525:           <View style={styles.meetingPrefsBox}>\n526:             <View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, marginBottom: 4 }}>\n527:               <Calendar size={14} color=\"#8B5CF6\" />\n528:               <Text style={styles.meetingPrefsTitle}>REQUESTED MEETING AVAILABILITY:</Text>\n529:             </View>\n530:             <View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 6 }}>\n531:               {currentLead.meeting_preferences.map((pref, idx) => (\n532:                 <View key={idx} style={styles.prefChip}>\n533:                   <Text style={styles.prefChipText}>{pref}</Text>\n534:                 </View>\n535:               ))}\n536:             </View>\n537:           </View>\n538:         )}\n539: \n540:         {/* Live Call Duration Meter */}\n541:         {isOnCall && (\n542:           <View style={styles.callDurationBox}>\n543:             <Clock size={16} color=\"#10B981\" />\n544:             <Text style={styles.callDurationText}>\n545:               Call in progress: {Math.floor(callDuration / 60)}:\n546:               {(callDuration % 60).toString().padStart(2, '0')}\n547:             </Text>\n548:           </View>\n549:         )}\n550: \n551:         {/* Big Dial Trigger Button */}\n552:         <TouchableOpacity\n553:           style={[styles.mainDialButton, isOnCall && { backgroundColor: '#059669' }]}\n554:           onPress={handleDial}\n555:           activeOpacity={0.8}\n556:         >\n557:           <PhoneCall size={24} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n558:           <Text style={styles.mainDialButtonText}>\n559:             {isOnCall ? 'Redial ' + currentLead.phone : 'Dial ' + currentLead.phone}\n560:           </Text>\n561:         </TouchableOpacity>\n562: \n563:         {/* Gesture Hint */}\n564:         <Text style={styles.gestureHint}>👉 Swipe right to Dial • Swipe left to Skip 👈</Text>\n565:       </Animated.View>\n566: \n567:       {/* Giant 1-Tap Disposition Controls */}\n568:       <View style={styles.dispositionContainer}>\n569:         <Text style={styles.dispositionHeading}>LOG CALL OUTCOME (1-TAP)</Text>\n570: \n571:         <View style={styles.buttonGrid}>\n572:           {/* No Answer / VM Drop */}\n573:           <TouchableOpacity\n574:             style={[styles.dispositionButton, { backgroundColor: '#F59E0B' }]}\n575:             onPress={() => handleDisposition('no_answer')}\n576:             activeOpacity={0.7}\n577:           >\n578:             <PhoneOff size={22} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n579:             <Text style={styles.dispositionButtonText}>No Answer / VM</Text>\n580:             <Text style={styles.dispositionSubtext}>Advance & check SMS</Text>\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":349,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:45:11Z","thinking":"**Adding Visual Verification**\n\nI'm currently focused on incorporating visual verification into the contact card functionality. I've decided to add `imageModalVisible` for controlling the modal's display and the necessary icons from `lucide-react-native`. I'm also planning a prominent \"View Original Card\" button and a full-screen, zoomable modal for displaying the image, complete with a consent badge.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from 'react';\nimport {\n  View,\n  Text,\n  StyleSheet,\n  TouchableOpacity,\n  SafeAreaView,\n  StatusBar,\n  Modal,\n  TextInput,\n  ActivityIndicator,\n  Alert,\n  Animated,\n  PanResponder,\n  ScrollView,\n  Image,\n} from 'react-native';\nimport {\n  PhoneCall,\n  PhoneOff,\n  MessageSquare,\n  CheckCircle2,\n  XCircle,\n  Pause,\n  Play,\n  SkipForward,\n  ArrowLeft,\n  User,\n  GraduationCap,\n  FileText,\n  Flame,\n  ShieldAlert,\n  Clock,\n  Globe,\n  AlertTriangle,\n  Calendar,\n  Sparkles,\n  HelpCircle,\n  School,\n  Check,\n  Eye,\n  FileCheck,\n  X,\n} from 'lucide-react-native';\nimport { LeadsRepository } from '../db/leadsRepository';\nimport { CallLogsRepository } from '../db/callLogsRepository';\nimport { SettingsRepository } from '../db/settingsRepository';\nimport { CadenceRepository } from '../db/cadenceRepository';\nimport { TelephonyService } from '../services/telephonyService';\nimport { CadenceEngine } from '../services/cadenceEngine';\nimport { HapticsService } from '../services/hapticsService';\nimport { TimeZoneService, ProspectTimeInfo } from '../services/timeZoneService';\nimport { Lead, CallDisposition, SMSTemplate, AppSettings } from '../types';\n\nexport default function DialerHudScreen({ route, navigation }: any) {\n  const { listId, listTitle } = route.params;\n\n  const [queue, setQueue] = useState<Lead[]>([]);\n  const [currentIndex, setCurrentIndex] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [autoAdvanceCountdown, setAutoAdvanceCountdown] = useState<number | null>(null);\n  const [isAutoPaused, setIsAutoPaused] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const [appSettings, setAppSettings] = useState<AppSettings | null>(null);\n\n  // Call duration counter\n  const [isOnCall, setIsOnCall] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const [callDuration, setCallDuration] = useState<number>(0);\n  const callTimerRef = useRef<NodeJS.Timeout | null>(null);\n\n  // Quick Notes modal for Connected calls\n  const [noteModalVisible, setNoteModalVisible] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const [callNote, setCallNote] = useState<string>('');\n\n  // Follow-up Scheduling Modal\n  const [followUpModalVisible, setFollowUpModalVisible] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const [followUpNote, setFollowUpNote] = useState<string>('');\n\n  // Multi-template SMS Modal\n  const [smsModalVisible, setSmsModalVisible] = useState<boolean>(false);\n  const [templates, setTemplates] = useState<SMSTemplate[]>([]);\n  const [selectedTemplate, setSelectedTemplate] = useState<SMSTemplate | null>(null);\n  const [customSmsBody, setCustomSmsBody] = useState<string>('');\n\n  // Original Card Image / Proof of Contact Modal\n  const [imageModalVisible, setImageModalVisible] = useState<boolean>(false);\n\n  // Session stats\n  const [sessionDials, setSessionDials] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [sessionConnects, setSessionConnects] = useState<number>(0);\n\n  const countdownTimerRef = useRef<NodeJS.Timeout | null>(null);\n\n  // Gesture Animation State\n  const pan = useRef(new Animated.ValueXY()).current;\n  const [swipeActionText, setSwipeActionText] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const loadQueue = async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    try {\n      const s = await SettingsRepository.getSettings();\n      setAppSettings(s);\n      const allTemplates = await CadenceRepository.getAllTemplates();\n      setTemplates(allTemplates);\n\n      const leads = await LeadsRepository.getDialingQueueForList(listId);\n      setQueue(leads);\n      setCurrentIndex(0);\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(e);\n      Alert.alert('Error', 'Failed to load dialing queue.');\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    loadQueue();\n    return () => {\n      if (countdownTimerRef.current) clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n      if (callTimerRef.current) clearInterval(callTimerRef.current);\n    };\n  }, [listId]);\n\n  const currentLead: Lead | undefined = queue[currentIndex];\n  const timeInfo: ProspectTimeInfo | null = currentLead\n    ? TimeZoneService.getProspectTimeInfo(currentLead.phone)\n    : null;\n\n  // Swipe Gesture Controller: Swipe Right -> Dial; Swipe Left -> Skip\n  const panResponder = useRef(\n    PanResponder.create({\n      onStartShouldSetPanResponder: () => true,\n      onPanResponderMove: (_, gestureState) => {\n        pan.setValue({ x: gestureState.dx, y: 0 });\n        if (gestureState.dx > 80) {\n          setSwipeActionText('📞 RELEASE TO DIAL');\n        } else if (gestureState.dx < -80) {\n          setSwipeActionText('⏭️ RELEASE TO SKIP');\n        } else {\n          setSwipeActionText(null);\n        }\n      },\n      onPanResponderRelease: (_, gestureState) => {\n        if (gestureState.dx > 120) {\n          Animated.spring(pan, { toValue: { x: 0, y: 0 }, useNativeDriver: false }).start();\n          setSwipeActionText(null);\n          handleDial();\n        } else if (gestureState.dx < -120) {\n          Animated.spring(pan, { toValue: { x: 0, y: 0 }, useNativeDriver: false }).start();\n          setSwipeActionText(null);\n          advanceNextLead();\n        } else {\n          Animated.spring(pan, { toValue: { x: 0, y: 0 }, useNativeDriver: false }).start();\n          setSwipeActionText(null);\n        }\n      },\n    })\n  ).current;\n\n  // Trigger outbound call via zero-cost native SIM bridge\n  const handleDial = async () => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n    await HapticsService.medium();\n    setSessionDials((prev) => prev + 1);\n    setIsOnCall(true);\n    setCallDuration(0);\n\n    if (callTimerRef.current) clearInterval(callTimerRef.current);\n    callTimerRef.current = setInterval(() => {\n      setCallDuration((prev) => prev + 1);\n    }, 1000);\n\n    await TelephonyService.makeCall(currentLead.phone);\n  };\n\n  // Disposition Handlers\n  const handleDisposition = async (disposition: CallDisposition, note?: string) => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n\n    if (disposition === 'connected') {\n      await HapticsService.success();\n      setSessionConnects((prev) => prev + 1);\n    } else if (disposition === 'bad_number') {\n      await HapticsService.heavy();\n    } else {\n      await HapticsService.tick();\n    }\n\n    if (callTimerRef.current) clearInterval(callTimerRef.current);\n    setIsOnCall(false);\n\n    if (countdownTimerRef.current) clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n    setAutoAdvanceCountdown(null);\n\n    // Evaluate cadence rule for SMS trigger\n    const cadenceResult = await CadenceEngine.evaluateCadence(currentLead, disposition);\n\n    // Save disposition to SQLite\n    await LeadsRepository.updateLeadDisposition(currentLead.id, disposition, note);\n    await CallLogsRepository.logCall({\n      leadId: currentLead.id,\n      listId: currentLead.list_id,\n      durationSeconds: callDuration,\n      disposition,\n      note,\n      smsSent: false,\n    });\n\n    // Check if we should prompt SMS\n    if (cadenceResult.shouldPromptSMS && cadenceResult.template) {\n      promptCadenceSMS(currentLead, cadenceResult.template);\n    } else {\n      startAutoAdvanceTimer();\n    }\n  };\n\n  const handleScheduleFollowUp = async (presetHours: number) => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n    await HapticsService.success();\n    setFollowUpModalVisible(false);\n\n    const followUpDate = new Date();\n    followUpDate.setHours(followUpDate.getHours() + presetHours);\n\n    await LeadsRepository.scheduleFollowUp(\n      currentLead.id,\n      followUpDate.toISOString(),\n      followUpNote || 'Scheduled Callback'\n    );\n\n    await CallLogsRepository.logCall({\n      leadId: currentLead.id,\n      listId: currentLead.list_id,\n      durationSeconds: 0,\n      disposition: 'callback_requested',\n      note: `Follow-up set for ${followUpDate.toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' })}`,\n    });\n\n    Alert.alert('Follow-Up Saved', `Callback scheduled for ${followUpDate.toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' })}.`);\n    startAutoAdvanceTimer();\n  };\n\n  const handleMarkDNC = async () => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n    await HapticsService.heavy();\n    await handleDisposition('do_not_call', 'Educator requested Do Not Call');\n  };\n\n  const promptCadenceSMS = (lead: Lead, template: SMSTemplate) => {\n    const interpolated = TelephonyService.interpolateTemplate(\n      template,\n      lead,\n      appSettings?.user_name || 'Alex'\n    );\n    Alert.alert(\n      'ValuTeachers SMS: Send Follow-Up Text?',\n      `\"${interpolated}\"`,\n      [\n        {\n          text: 'Skip SMS',\n          style: 'cancel',\n          onPress: () => startAutoAdvanceTimer(),\n        },\n        {\n          text: 'Send Pre-filled Text',\n          onPress: async () => {\n            await HapticsService.medium();\n            await TelephonyService.sendSMS(lead.phone, interpolated);\n            startAutoAdvanceTimer();\n          },\n        },\n      ]\n    );\n  };\n\n  const openSmsModal = async () => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n    await HapticsService.tick();\n    if (templates.length > 0) {\n      const first = templates[0];\n      setSelectedTemplate(first);\n      setCustomSmsBody(\n        TelephonyService.interpolateTemplate(first, currentLead, appSettings?.user_name || 'Alex')\n      );\n    } else {\n      setCustomSmsBody(\n        `Hi ${currentLead.name.split(' ')[0]}, this is ${appSettings?.user_name || 'Alex'} with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${currentLead.school || 'your school'}. When is a good time to connect today?`\n      );\n    }\n    setSmsModalVisible(true);\n  };\n\n  const handleSendCustomSms = async () => {\n    if (!currentLead) return;\n    await HapticsService.medium();\n    setSmsModalVisible(false);\n    await TelephonyService.sendSMS(currentLead.phone, customSmsBody);\n    await CallLogsRepository.logCall({\n      leadId: currentLead.id,\n      listId: currentLead.list_id,\n      durationSeconds: 0,\n      disposition: 'callback_requested',\n      note: 'Sent manual ValuTeachers SMS',\n      smsSent: true,\n      smsBody: customSmsBody,\n    });\n  };\n\n  const startAutoAdvanceTimer = () => {\n    if (isAutoPaused || !appSettings?.auto_advance_enabled) {\n      advanceNextLead();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const duration = appSettings?.auto_advance_seconds || 3;\n    setAutoAdvanceCountdown(duration);\n    let secondsLeft = duration;\n\n    if (countdownTimerRef.current) clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n    countdownTimerRef.current = setInterval(() => {\n      HapticsService.tick();\n      secondsLeft -= 1;\n      if (secondsLeft <= 0) {\n        if (countdownTimerRef.current) clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n        setAutoAdvanceCountdown(null);\n        advanceNextLead();\n      } else {\n        setAutoAdvanceCountdown(secondsLeft);\n      }\n    }, 1000);\n  };\n\n  const advanceNextLead = () => {\n    if (currentIndex + 1 < queue.length) {\n      setCurrentIndex((prev) => prev + 1);\n    } else {\n      loadQueue();\n    }\n  };\n\n  const togglePause = async () => {\n    await HapticsService.tick();\n    if (countdownTimerRef.current) {\n      clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n      setAutoAdvanceCountdown(null);\n    }\n    setIsAutoPaused(!isAutoPaused);\n  };\n\n  if (loading) {\n    return (\n      <SafeAreaView style={styles.container}>\n        <View style={styles.centerContainer}>\n          <ActivityIndicator size=\"large\" color=\"#3B82F6\" />\n          <Text style={styles.loadingText}>Loading ValuTeachers Queue...</Text>\n        </View>\n      </SafeAreaView>\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Finished queue\n  if (!currentLead || queue.length === 0) {\n    return (\n      <SafeAreaView style={styles.container}>\n        <StatusBar barStyle=\"light-content\" backgroundColor=\"#0F172A\" />\n        <View style={styles.finishedContainer}>\n          <Flame size={64} color=\"#F59E0B\" />\n          <Text style={styles.finishedTitle}>Session Complete!</Text>\n          <Text style={styles.finishedSubtitle}>\n            You have called all active educators in \"{listTitle}\".\n          </Text>\n\n          <View style={styles.sessionSummaryBox}>\n            <View style={styles.summaryItem}>\n              <Text style={styles.summaryVal}>{sessionDials}</Text>\n              <Text style={styles.summaryLabel}>Total Dials</Text>\n            </View>\n            <View style={styles.summaryDivider} />\n            <View style={styles.summaryItem}>\n              <Text style={[styles.summaryVal, { color: '#10B981' }]}>{sessionConnects}</Text>\n              <Text style={styles.summaryLabel}>Connects</Text>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            style={styles.returnButton}\n            onPress={() => navigation.navigate('Lists')}\n          >\n            <Text style={styles.returnButtonText}>Back to Lead Lists</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n        </View>\n      </SafeAreaView>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <SafeAreaView style={styles.container}>\n      <StatusBar barStyle=\"light-content\" backgroundColor=\"#0F172A\" />\n\n      {/* Top Header */}\n      <View style={styles.header}>\n        <TouchableOpacity\n          onPress={() => navigation.navigate('Lists')}\n          style={styles.backButton}\n        >\n          <ArrowLeft size={22} color=\"#F8FAFC\" />\n        </TouchableOpacity>\n        <View style={{ alignItems: 'center' }}>\n          <Text style={styles.queueCounter}>\n            Educator {currentIndex + 1} of {queue.length}\n          </Text>\n          <Text style={styles.listSubheading}>{listTitle}</Text>\n        </View>\n        <TouchableOpacity onPress={togglePause} style={styles.pauseButton}>\n          {isAutoPaused ? (\n            <Play size={20} color=\"#10B981\" />\n          ) : (\n            <Pause size={20} color=\"#94A3B8\" />\n          )}\n        </TouchableOpacity>\n      </View>\n\n      {/* Auto Advance Countdown Banner */}\n      {autoAdvanceCountdown !== null && (\n        <View style={styles.countdownBanner}>\n          <Text style={styles.countdownText}>\n            Advancing to next contact in {autoAdvanceCountdown}s...\n          </Text>\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            onPress={() => {\n              if (countdownTimerRef.current) clearInterval(countdownTimerRef.current);\n              setAutoAdvanceCountdown(null);\n            }}\n          >\n            <Text style={styles.countdownCancel}>Pause</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n        </View>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Main Swipeable Educator Contact Card */}\n      <Animated.View\n        style={[\n          styles.contactCard,\n          {\n            transform: [{ translateX: pan.x }],\n          },\n        ]}\n        {...panResponder.panHandlers}\n      >\n        {/* Swipe Feedback Banner */}\n        {swipeActionText && (\n          <View style={styles.swipeIndicator}>\n            <Text style={styles.swipeIndicatorText}>{swipeActionText}</Text>\n          </View>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Educator Header & School */}\n        <View style={styles.contactTopRow}>\n          <View style={styles.avatarCircle}>\n            <GraduationCap size={28} color=\"#38BDF8\" />\n          </View>\n          <View style={{ flex: 1, marginLeft: 12 }}>\n            <Text style={styles.contactName}>{currentLead.name}</Text>\n            <Text style={styles.contactPhone}>{currentLead.phone}</Text>\n            {currentLead.email ? (\n              <Text style={styles.contactEmail}>{currentLead.email}</Text>\n            ) : null}\n          </View>\n          <View style={styles.attemptBadge}>\n            <Text style={styles.attemptText}>\n              Call #{currentLead.attempts_count + 1}\n            </Text>\n          </View>\n        </View>\n\n        {/* School & FRS Profile Ribbon */}\n        <View style={styles.frsRibbon}>\n          <View style={styles.ribbonItem}>\n            <School size={14} color=\"#38BDF8\" />\n            <Text style={styles.ribbonText}>\n              {currentLead.school || 'School District'}\n              {currentLead.room_number ? ` • Rm ${currentLead.room_number}` : ''}\n              {currentLead.planning_period ? ` • ${currentLead.planning_period}` : ''}\n            </Text>\n          </View>\n          <View style={styles.ribbonRow}>\n            {currentLead.years_in_frs ? (\n              <View style={styles.tagBadge}>\n                <Text style={styles.tagText}>🎓 {currentLead.years_in_frs} Yrs in FRS</Text>\n              </View>\n            ) : null}\n            {currentLead.age ? (\n              <View style={styles.tagBadge}>\n                <Text style={styles.tagText}>Age: {currentLead.age}</Text>\n              </View>\n            ) : null}\n            {currentLead.frs_knowledge ? (\n              <View style={[styles.tagBadge, { backgroundColor: 'rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15)', borderColor: '#F59E0B' }]}>\n                <Text style={[styles.tagText, { color: '#F59E0B' }]}>\n                  FRS: \"{currentLead.frs_knowledge}\"\n                </Text>\n              </View>\n            ) : null}\n          </View>\n        </View>\n\n        {/* FRS Report Card Checkboxes / Hot-Buttons */}\n        {currentLead.frs_interests && currentLead.frs_interests.length > 0 && (\n          <View style={styles.interestsBox}>\n            <Text style={styles.interestsHeader}>REPORT CARD NEEDS & QUESTIONS:</Text>\n            {currentLead.frs_interests.map((interest, idx) => (\n              <View key={idx} style={styles.interestRow}>\n                <Check size={14} color=\"#10B981\" />\n                <Text style={styles.interestText}>{interest}</Text>\n              </View>\n            ))}\n          </View>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Custom Written Questions */}\n        {currentLead.custom_questions ? (\n          <View style={styles.customQuestionBox}>\n            <HelpCircle size={14} color=\"#F59E0B\" />\n            <Text style={styles.customQuestionText}>\n              Q: \"{currentLead.custom_questions}\"\n            </Text>\n          </View>\n        ) : null}\n\n        {/* Preferred Meeting Availability Callout */}\n        {currentLead.meeting_preferences && currentLead.meeting_preferences.length > 0 && (\n          <View style={styles.meetingPrefsBox}>\n            <View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, marginBottom: 4 }}>\n              <Calendar size={14} color=\"#8B5CF6\" />\n              <Text style={styles.meetingPrefsTitle}>REQUESTED MEETING AVAILABILITY:</Text>\n            </View>\n            <View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 6 }}>\n              {currentLead.meeting_preferences.map((pref, idx) => (\n                <View key={idx} style={styles.prefChip}>\n                  <Text style={styles.prefChipText}>{pref}</Text>\n                </View>\n              ))}\n            </View>\n          </View>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Proof of Contact / View Scanned Sheet Button */}\n        <TouchableOpacity\n          style={styles.proofButton}\n          onPress={() => {\n            HapticsService.tick();\n            setImageModalVisible(true);\n          }}\n          activeOpacity={0.7}\n        >\n          <FileCheck size={16} color=\"#38BDF8\" />\n          <Text style={styles.proofButtonText}>View Original Report Card (Proof of Request)</Text>\n          <Eye size={16} color=\"#38BDF8\" />\n        </TouchableOpacity>\n\n        {/* Live Call Duration Meter */}\n        {isOnCall && (\n          <View style={styles.callDurationBox}>\n            <Clock size={16} color=\"#10B981\" />\n            <Text style={styles.callDurationText}>\n              Call in progress: {Math.floor(callDuration / 60)}:\n              {(callDuration % 60).toString().padStart(2, '0')}\n            </Text>\n          </View>\n        )}\n\n        {/* Big Dial Trigger Button */}\n        <TouchableOpacity\n          style={[styles.mainDialButton, isOnCall && { backgroundColor: '#059669' }]}\n          onPress={handleDial}\n          activeOpacity={0.8}\n        >\n          <PhoneCall size={24} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n          <Text style={styles.mainDialButtonText}>\n            {isOnCall ? 'Redial ' + currentLead.phone : 'Dial ' + currentLead.phone}\n          </Text>\n        </TouchableOpacity>\n\n        {/* Gesture Hint */}\n        <Text style={styles.gestureHint}>👉 Swipe right to Dial • Swipe left to Skip 👈</Text>\n      </Animated.View>\n\n      {/* Giant 1-Tap Disposition Controls */}\n      <View style={styles.dispositionContainer}>\n        <Text style={styles.dispositionHeading}>LOG CALL OUTCOME (1-TAP)</Text>\n\n        <View style={styles.buttonGrid}>\n          {/* No Answer / VM Drop */}\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            style={[styles.dispositionButton, { backgroundColor: '#F59E0B' }]}\n            onPress={() => handleDisposition('no_answer')}\n            activeOpacity={0.7}\n          >\n            <PhoneOff size={22} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionButtonText}>No Answer / VM</Text>\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionSubtext}>Advance & check SMS</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n\n          {/* Connected / Qualified */}\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            style={[styles.dispositionButton, { backgroundColor: '#10B981' }]}\n            onPress={() => {\n              setCallNote('');\n              setNoteModalVisible(true);\n            }}\n            activeOpacity={0.7}\n          >\n            <CheckCircle2 size={22} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionButtonText}>Connected</Text>\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionSubtext}>Record meeting date</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n\n          {/* Quick SMS */}\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            style={[styles.dispositionButton, { backgroundColor: '#3B82F6' }]}\n            onPress={openSmsModal}\n            activeOpacity={0.7}\n          >\n            <MessageSquare size={22} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionButtonText}>ValuTeachers SMS</Text>\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionSubtext}>Confirm meeting</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n\n          {/* Schedule Follow-up */}\n          <TouchableOpacity\n            style={[styles.dispositionButton, { backgroundColor: '#8B5CF6' }]}\n            onPress={() => setFollowUpModalVisible(true)}\n            activeOpacity={0.7}\n          >\n            <Calendar size={22} color=\"#FFFFFF\" />\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionButtonText}>Callback</Text>\n            <Text style={styles.dispositionSubtext}>Schedule reminder</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n        </View>\n\n        {/* Bottom Actions Row */}\n        <View style={styles.bottomActionsRow}>\n          <TouchableOpacity style={styles.dncLinkButton} onPress={handleMarkDNC}>\n            <ShieldAlert size={16} color=\"#EF4444\" />\n            <Text style={styles.dncLinkText}>Block / DNC</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n\n          <TouchableOpacity style={styles.skipButton} onPress={advanceNextLead}>\n            <SkipForward size={16} color=\"#94A3B8\" />\n            <Text style={styles.skipButtonText}>Skip Contact</Text>\n          </TouchableOpacity>\n        </View>\n      </View>\n\n      {/* Proof of Request / Original Image Modal */}\n      <Modal visible={imageModalVisible} animationType=\"slide\" transparent>\n        <View style={styles.imageModalOverlay}>\n          <View style={styles.imageModalContent}>\n            <View style={styles.imageModalHeader}>\n              <View style={{ flex: 1 }}>\n                <Text style={styles.imageModalTitle}>Proof of Contact Request</Text>\n                <Text style={styles.imageModalSubtitle}>\n                  {currentLead.name} • {currentLead.school || 'ValuTeachers'}\n                </Text>\n              </View>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.imageModalCloseBtn}\n                onPress={() => setImageModalVisible(false)}\n              >\n                <X size={22} color=\"#F8FAFC\" />\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n\n            <View style={styles.imageFrame}>\n              <Image\n                source={\n                  currentLead.source_image_uri\n                    ? { uri: currentLead.source_image_uri }\n                    : require('../assets/sample_report_card.png')\n                }\n                style={styles.proofImage}\n                resizeMode=\"contain\"\n              />\n            </View>\n\n            <View style={styles.complianceFooter}>\n              <FileCheck size={16} color=\"#10B981\" />\n              <Text style={styles.complianceText}>\n                Verified Written Consent & Report Card Submission on Record\n              </Text>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n        </View>\n      </Modal>\n\n      {/* Connected Call Notes Modal */}\n      <Modal visible={noteModalVisible} animationType=\"slide\" transparent>\n        <View style={styles.modalOverlay}>\n          <View style={styles.modalContent}>\n            <Text style={styles.modalTitle}>Meeting Notes: {currentLead.name}</Text>\n            <TextInput\n              style={styles.modalInput}\n              placeholder=\"Enter scheduled meeting time, retirement goals, or follow-up details...\"\n              placeholderTextColor=\"#64748B\"\n              multiline\n              numberOfLines={4}\n              value={callNote}\n              onChangeText={setCallNote}\n              autoFocus\n            />\n            <View style={styles.modalButtons}>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.modalCancelButton}\n                onPress={() => setNoteModalVisible(false)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.modalCancelText}>Cancel</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.modalSaveButton}\n                onPress={() => {\n                  setNoteModalVisible(false);\n                  handleDisposition('connected', callNote);\n                }}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.modalSaveText}>Save & Next</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n        </View>\n      </Modal>\n\n      {/* Schedule Follow-up Modal */}\n      <Modal visible={followUpModalVisible} animationType=\"slide\" transparent>\n        <View style={styles.modalOverlay}>\n          <View style={styles.modalContent}>\n            <Text style={styles.modalTitle}>Schedule Callback: {currentLead.name}</Text>\n            <Text style={{ color: '#94A3B8', fontSize: 13, marginBottom: 12 }}>\n              Choose a quick callback window based on educator availability:\n            </Text>\n\n            <View style={styles.presetButtonsGrid}>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.presetBtn}\n                onPress={() => handleScheduleFollowUp(2)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.presetBtnText}>⏱️ In 2 Hours</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.presetBtn}\n                onPress={() => handleScheduleFollowUp(24)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.presetBtnText}>🌅 Tomorrow 10 AM</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.presetBtn}\n                onPress={() => handleScheduleFollowUp(48)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.presetBtnText}>📅 In 2 Days</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.presetBtn}\n                onPress={() => handleScheduleFollowUp(168)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.presetBtnText}>📆 Next Week</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n\n            <TextInput\n              style={[styles.modalInput, { height: 60, marginTop: 12 }]}\n              placeholder=\"Add reminder note (e.g. Call back during 4th period planning)...\"\n              placeholderTextColor=\"#64748B\"\n              value={followUpNote}\n              onChangeText={setFollowUpNote}\n            />\n\n            <View style={styles.modalButtons}>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.modalCancelButton}\n                onPress={() => setFollowUpModalVisible(false)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.modalCancelText}>Cancel</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n        </View>\n      </Modal>\n\n      {/* Multi-template SMS Modal */}\n      <Modal visible={smsModalVisible} animationType=\"slide\" transparent>\n        <View style={styles.modalOverlay}>\n          <View style={styles.modalContent}>\n            <Text style={styles.modalTitle}>ValuTeachers SMS Templates</Text>\n\n            {/* Template Selector */}\n            <View style={styles.templateScroll}>\n              {templates.map((tpl) => (\n                <TouchableOpacity\n                  key={tpl.id}\n                  style={[\n                    styles.templateChip,\n                    selectedTemplate?.id === tpl.id && styles.activeChip,\n                  ]}\n                  onPress={() => {\n                    HapticsService.tick();\n                    setSelectedTemplate(tpl);\n                    setCustomSmsBody(\n                      TelephonyService.interpolateTemplate(\n                        tpl,\n                        currentLead,\n                        appSettings?.user_name || 'Alex'\n                      )\n                    );\n                  }}\n                >\n                  <Text\n                    style={[\n                      styles.templateChipText,\n                      selectedTemplate?.id === tpl.id && styles.activeChipText,\n                    ]}\n                  >\n                    {tpl.title}\n                  </Text>\n                </TouchableOpacity>\n              ))}\n            </View>\n\n            <TextInput\n              style={[styles.modalInput, { height: 110, marginTop: 12 }]}\n              value={customSmsBody}\n              onChangeText={setCustomSmsBody}\n              multiline\n            />\n\n            <View style={styles.modalButtons}>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={styles.modalCancelButton}\n                onPress={() => setSmsModalVisible(false)}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.modalCancelText}>Cancel</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n              <TouchableOpacity\n                style={[styles.modalSaveButton, { backgroundColor: '#2563EB' }]}\n                onPress={handleSendCustomSms}\n              >\n                <Text style={styles.modalSaveText}>Open in SMS</Text>\n              </TouchableOpacity>\n            </View>\n          </View>\n        </View>\n      </Modal>\n    </SafeAreaView>\n  );\n}\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  container: {\n    flex: 1,\n    backgroundColor: '#0F172A',\n  },\n  header: {\n    flexDirection: 'row',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    justifyContent: 'space-between',\n    paddingHorizontal: 16,\n    paddingVertical: 12,\n    borderBottomWidth: 1,\n    borderBottomColor: '#1E293B',\n  },\n  backButton: {\n    padding: 8,\n  },\n  queueCounter: {\n    fontSize: 16,\n    fontWeight: '700',\n    color: '#F8FAFC',\n  },\n  listSubheading: {\n    fontSize: 12,\n    color: '#94A3B8',\n  },\n  pauseButton: {\n    padding: 8,\n  },\n  countdownBanner: {\n    flexDirection: 'row',\n    justifyContent: 'space-between',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    backgroundColor: '#1E3A8A',\n    paddingVertical: 10,\n    paddingHorizontal: 20,\n  },\n  countdownText: {\n    color: '#93C5FD',\n    fontSize: 13,\n    fontWeight: '600',\n  },\n  countdownCancel: {\n    color: '#FFFFFF',\n    fontWeight: '700',\n    fontSize: 13,\n  },\n  contactCard: {\n    backgroundColor: '#1E293B',\n    margin: 14,\n    borderRadius: 20,\n    padding: 16,\n    borderWidth: 1,\n    borderColor: '#334155',\n  },\n  swipeIndicator: {\n    backgroundColor: '#2563EB',\n    paddingVertical: 4,\n    borderRadius: 6,\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    marginBottom: 8,\n  },\n  swipeIndicatorText: {\n    color: '#FFFFFF',\n    fontWeight: '700',\n    fontSize: 12,\n  },\n  contactTopRow: {\n    flexDirection: 'row',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n  },\n  avatarCircle: {\n    width: 48,\n    height: 48,\n    borderRadius: 24,\n    backgroundColor: '#0F172A',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n    justifyContent: 'center',\n    borderWidth: 1,\n    borderColor: '#38BDF8',\n  },\n  contactName: {\n    fontSize: 19,\n    fontWeight: '800',\n    color: '#F8FAFC',\n  },\n  contactPhone: {\n    fontSize: 15,\n    color: '#38BDF8',\n    fontWeight: '600',\n    marginTop: 1,\n  },\n  contactEmail: {\n    fontSize: 12,\n    color: '#94A3B8',\n    marginTop: 1,\n  },\n  attemptBadge: {\n    backgroundColor: '#334155',\n    paddingHorizontal: 8,\n    paddingVertical: 4,\n    borderRadius: 8,\n  },\n  attemptText: {\n    color: '#